## AI model weights

The face detection and recognition models are **not** part of this source
repository and are **not** covered by the MIT License of this project.

- Detection: RetinaFace (MobileNetV2) weights distributed by UniFace.
- Recognition: AdaFace IR-18 weights distributed by the AdaFace ONNX project.

PeopleLens downloads these files at install time or on first use and verifies
their SHA-256 checksums. Review the upstream model terms before redistributing
the weights yourself:

- https://github.com/yakhyo/uniface
- https://github.com/yakhyo/adaface-onnx
- https://github.com/mk-minchul/AdaFace
- https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface

The model training datasets may carry terms that differ from the code license.
